# Every file needs a reviewer. Order matters: the last matching rule wins.
#
# CODEOWNERS fails open: if the handle does not exist or lacks write access,
# no review is requested and the file looks identical to a working one. Verify
# in a test PR after enabling branch protection.

* @demilade-o

# Anything that can publish, weaken a gate, or change what ships is
# security-sensitive and must never be self-merged without review.
/.github/workflows/   @demilade-o
/.github/CODEOWNERS   @demilade-o
/scripts/             @demilade-o
/pyproject.toml       @demilade-o
/uv.lock              @demilade-o
/LICENSE              @demilade-o
/NOTICE               @demilade-o
